      161.85,
      226.97,
      401.85,
      238.31
    ],
    "text": "AN ACT TO REGULATE THE EXPENDITURE INCURRED BY CANDIDATES AT",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      173.85,
      238.97,
      401.85,
      298.31
    ],
    "text": "EVERY ELECTION CONDUCTED UNDER THE LOCAL AUTHORITIESELECTIONS ORDINANCE (CHAPTER 262); THE PROVINCIAL COUNCILSELECTIONS ACT, NO. 2 OF 1988; THE PARLIAMENTARY ELECTIONSACT, NO. 1 OF 1981 AND THE PRESIDENTIAL ELECTIONS ACT,NO. 15 OF 1981 AND TO PROVIDE FOR MATTERS CONNECTED",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      173.85,
      298.97,
      301.39,
      310.31
    ],
    "text": "THEREWITH AND INCIDENTAL THERETO.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      322.97,
      401.9,
      346.31
    ],
    "text": "BE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka as follows: -",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      358.97,
      401.89,
      382.31
    ],
    "text": "1. This Act may be cited as the Regulation of ElectionExpenditure Act, No. \u2026\u2026. of 2022.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Bold",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      394.97,
      401.86,
      418.31
    ],
    "text": "2. The provisions of this Act shall apply to every electionconducted under \u2013",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Bold",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      177.57,
      430.97,
      401.88,
      454.31
    ],
    "text": "(a)the Local Authorities Elections Ordinance(Chapter 262);",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Italic",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      177.57,
      466.97,
      401.87,
      490.31
    ],
    "text": "(b)the Provincial Councils Elections Act, No. 2 of1988;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Italic",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      178.29,
      502.97,
      401.87,
      526.31
    ],
    "text": "(c)the Parliamentary Elections Act, No. 1 of 1981;and",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Italic",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      177.57,
      538.97,
      387.58,
      550.31
    ],
    "text": "(d)the Presidential Elections Act, No. 15 of 1981.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Italic",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      562.97,
      401.93,
      670.31
    ],
    "text": "3. (1) After the conclusion of the period of nominationspecified in the Proclamation or Order requiring the conductof an election under any law specified in section 2, theElection Commission shall, in consultation with recognizedpolitical parties, independent groups and other candidatescontesting such election, fix by Order published in theGazette, a sum of money in Sri Lankan rupees to be used forthe purpose of calculating the authorized amount inaccordance with the provisions of this Act, for such election.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Bold",
      "Times-BoldItalic",
      "Times-Italic",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      407.85,
      360.55,
      442.3,
      369.62
    ],
    "text": "Short title",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      407.85,
      396.55,
      449.14,
      415.22
    ],
    "text": "Applicationof this Act",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0
